    {
      "text": "State report 2025 application row M-2025-001 lists APNs 316-20-121 and 316-20-120; 316-20-120 is not in the county parcel dataset. The 2018 rows (DP-2018-02) list APNs 316-20-080, -081, -094, -095, -099, -100, -101, -103, -104, -105, -106 and -107.",
