        "SRC-001100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City project page: office about 1.97 million sq ft (2018), 1.95 million (second modification, 2023), 1.475 million (third modification, 2025); retail about 226,000 sq ft (second modification) and 226,600 sq ft (third modification). Original 2018 approval was 2,402 units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "San Jose Spotlight, Dec. 2025: revised plan delivered Nov. 26, 2025 keeps 2,669 homes on 50 acres, cuts affordable homes from 890 to 356 and office from 2 million to 1.5 million sq ft; first phase (Town Center West) is housing and retail on eight blocks along Stevens Creek Boulevard, with first occupancy expected in 2028.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001986"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SV@Home, Feb. 2026: the first residential building is 232 affordable homes by Sand Hill Property Company and Eden Housing; it has its own record, Block 5 Apartments.",
